# Slice-first workflow

KB is ~1k+ lines across `docs/research/07*`. **Do not load all of it** each turn.

## Before coding a slice

Read **only**:

1. `docs/research/07d-impl-kb-adr-dod.md` — ADR defaults (skim)
2. **Current slice** section in `docs/research/07c-impl-kb-slices.md`
3. If domain/repo work → matching cards in `07a-impl-kb-domain-persistence.md`
4. If UI work → **only** components for that slice in `07b-impl-kb-components.md`

Skip `02-deep-research-report.md` / full SPEC unless resolving a conflict.

## Build order (binding)

`0 scaffold → 1 domain/memory → 2 rooms (+Vercel) → 3 folders → 4 PDF → 5 polish/seed → 6 IDB → 7 Move(±DnD) → 8 README/ship`

Finish exit criteria + DoD for the active slice before starting the next.

## Agent prompts

Use Package A–G stubs in `07c-impl-kb-slices.md` — one package per turn, not “build entire app”.
